{
  "path": "/client_appointments/{id}{format}",
  "method": "delete",
  "operation": {
    "summary": "Delete Client Appointments",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Permanently deletes a client appointment by id. This is a hard delete and cannot be undone. If the appointment belongs to a recurring series and was its last remaining occurrence, the recurring series is removed as well. Requires permission to edit/delete appointments. The appointment is identified by the `id` path parameter; there is no request body.",
